WEBVTT

00:01.000 --> 00:03.300
The snow was soft.

00:03.420 --> 00:07.000
That tells us. But how soft is it?

00:07.120 --> 00:11.870
A simile compares two things, using like or as.

00:11.990 --> 00:14.820
The snow was as soft as a pillow.

00:14.940 --> 00:17.490
Now you can almost feel it.

00:17.610 --> 00:22.740
Here is one more. His tail thumped the floor like a drum.

00:22.860 --> 00:28.025
So look for like or as, and try one in your own writing!
